{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WqhKpWUXgKJR6Kkebj9kor","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (45.9KB). Full output saved to: /home/agent-home/.claude/projects/-workspace-paper/d2479a9e-e8d3-4dec-9fbb-cae951098cd8/tool-results/b2d50hzyt.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\nVENUE.md\nclaims_grounding.json\nderived\ndraft_reference_gaps_agent_claude_20261111_140816.log\ndraft_reference_gaps_prompt.md\nfigure_manifest.json\nfigures\nglobal_memory\nglobal_memory_recent.json\nglobal_memory_summary.md\nmemory.md\npaper.aux\npaper.bbl\npaper.blg\npaper.bst\npaper.log\npaper.out\npaper.pdf\npaper.sty\npaper.tex\npaper_agent_claude_20261111_140816.log\npaper_data.json\npaper_diagnostics\npaper_diagnostics_20261111_140816_47164.log\npaper_events_20261111_140816.jsonl\npaper_prep_20261111_140816.json\npaper_prompt.md\npaper_strategy.json\npaper_strategy.md\npaper_strategy_agent_claude_20261111_140816.log\npaper_strategy_prompt.md\npaper_strategy_resolution.json\nreference_query_plan.json\nreference_query_plan.md\nreference_query_plan_agent_claude_20261111_140816.log\nreference_query_plan_prompt.md\nreference_query_plan_validation_feedback.json\nreference_query_plan_validation_feedback.md\nreference_retrieval.log\nreferences.bib\nreferences_provenance.json\nresults\nscientific-evidence\nscripts\nsource_evidence\nstrategy_validation_feedback.json\nstrategy_validation_feedback.md\ntask\n42743 paper.tex\n 9829 references.bib\n52572 total\n\\documentclass{article}\n% --- watermark (auto-inserted) ---\n\\usepackage{xcolor}\n\\usepackage{xfp}% \\fpeval; in the kernel since 2022, harmless on older LaTeX\n\\usepackage{draftwatermark}\n\\newlength{\\watermarkTextWidth}\n\\AddToHook{begindocument/end}{%\n  \\SetWatermarkText{\\normalfont Generated by The Agentic Scientist}%\n  \\SetWatermarkFontSize{10pt}%\n  \\SetWatermarkLightness{0.85}%\n  \\settowidth{\\watermarkTextWidth}{\\normalfont\\fontsize{10pt}{12pt}\\selectfont